# CODEOWNERS
# Routes PRs to the right reviewer based on which files changed.
# GitHub auto-requests review from the matching owner(s) below.
#
# Solo portfolio project: @apra authors, @apra-reviewer approves —
# a second real account standing in for a teammate, so the review
# gate is genuinely enforced rather than just configured for show.

/auth-service/          @apra-reviewer
/orders-service/        @apra-reviewer
/notifications-service/ @apra-reviewer

# Shared/root-level files require review from a platform owner,
# since changes here affect every team.
/.github/                @apra-reviewer
/README.md                @apra-reviewer